    "description": "Computer / software engineers are involved in effective and efficient building of knowledge agent systems that satisfy the requirements of users, possibly software for intelligent embedded and intelligent information systems. General awareness of theory, knowledge, and practice in all phases of the knowledge based systems and representation techniques for problem solving are necessary for those of you who wants to get into the field artificial intelligence. These are advanced intelligent systems that are finding widespread applications in finance, banking, manufacturing industries.",
