    "code": "CZ4062",
    "name": "COMPUTER SECURITY",
    "description": "This course aims to equip you with foundational knowledge on many important security issues and techniques required for cyber security. You will have the knowledge of different security policies and security models, and have the ability to recognise security features and discover pitfalls in computing systems, including the operating system and software.",
