    "code": "DD0003",
    "name": "INFORMATION VISUALIZATION",
    "description": "This introductory level course will provide an overview of the practice of information visualization. You will explore fundamental visual design techniques to interpret, organize and present visual interpretations for different forms of data. The learnings achieved in this course will expand your understanding on how complex information can be communicated meaningfully and clearly through visualization to inspire greater empathy and understanding from an audience.",
