    "description": "This course will introduce you to both contemporary and historical techniques and experimental aspects of the photographic medium. You will gain a repertoire and understanding of diverse techniques that yield interesting results. Many of these techniques can be achieved without access to darkrooms and even without using cameras. The emphasis in this class will be on creativity and experimentation.",
