    "code": "DR5003",
    "name": "INTRODUCTION TO DESIGN",
    "description": "In this introductory level course, you will be introduced to the overall concept of design and its role in creating communications, objects, interactions, services and environments. You will be introduced the creative process of design and the various methods and tools that enable design solutions. You will gain insights into creating design solutions for people, context, behaviour, technology and business. This course will prepare you for future studies in fields related to design and design thinking.",
