    "code": "DT3012",
    "name": "ACTING FOR ANIMATION",
    "description": "In this course you will learn and apply a range of animation gesture processes to create expressive animated characters. Through critical analysis of acting and dialogue, you will develop facial and full body animations that convey personality, as you place your character within a meaningful contextual narrative. The learning from this course will help you to strengthen the performance capabilities of any future character animation.",
