    "name": "STOP MOTION SEMINAR",
    "description": "This course will introduce you to the theoretical, experimental and production processes of stop motion animation. You will analyse a range of stop motion animations, explore and develop industry-level production methods, and employ these to create a stop motion movie in collaboration with fellow students. This practical approach will provide a collection of knowledge and practices that can be applied to contemporary stop motion practice.",
