    "code": "DV2002",
    "name": "ILLUSTRATION FOR DESIGNERS",
    "description": "This Intermediate level, studio-based course will introduce you to illustrative visual communication placing emphasis on personal investigation and discovery through experimentation with a variety of media and techniques. You will be encouraged to create a body of stylised and conceptual illustrations, whilst considering their practical application. This learning provides a holistic approach in informing your visual voice and underpins the creative strategies applied in further creative practice.",
