    "code": "DV2008",
    "name": "INTERFACE DESIGN",
    "description": "In this course you will be introduced to the process of interface design and user interface experience. Informed by interface behaviour research, you will design and create interfaces for specific purposes, which will be continually tested as part of an iterative design process. This learning will inform future interface design decisions, for both screen and physical interfaces.",
    "prereq": null,
