    "description": "The course aims to provide Year 4 electrical and electronic undergraduates with a strong foundation in design methodologies of RF circuits. The fundamental theoretical and design knowledge will allow you to design various circuit building blocks in a typical RF transceiver. Contents: Radio-frequency input-circuits and impedance matching. RF Transistor Amplifiers. Mixers. Oscillators. Phase-Locked Loop circuits. RF Power Amplifiers.",
