    "description": "The course offers important topics for analog, digital and mixed-signal integrated circuits. It covers circuit operation, circuit analysis, design techniques and methodologies, implementation approaches, low-voltage lowpower CMOS circuit design, and key building blocks for integrated circuit designs.",
