    "description": "This course aims to introduce you to a broad range of physics-related industries. On completion of the course, you will appreciate how physics is being applied to a wide range of industries and can make a more informed decision on the industries that better suit your career interests. Topics include -\tIndustry 1: Physics in the Electronics Industry -\tIndustry 2: Physics in the Optics Industry -\tIndustry 3: Soft Condensed Matter Physics in the Industry -\tIndustry 4: Physics in the Biomedical Industry -\tIndustry 5: Physics Modelling in the Financial Industry",
