    "description": "Artificial intelligence is finding widespread applications in finance, banking, healthcare, manufacturing and many other industries. This course is an introduction course to artificial intelligence to students who are not from computer science or computer engineering background. It will introduce to you what artificial intelligence is about and its fundamentals and applications. You will learn how software systems make intelligent search for problem solutions, how intelligent systems learn to perform their tasks. These are fundamental knowledge for intelligent systems. You will also gain basic understanding of generative AI.",
