    "description": "This lecture/practical course is designed to provide a basic framework that will aid first year students in acquiring knowledge and practical skills pertinent to Hockey. This course will cover the fundamentals skills and techniques of hockey and tactics used in the game. The practical sessions enhance knowledge and skills to enable you to understand and attain fundamental demonstration skills of hockey.",
